# 01_basics.mc — Basic arithmetic, comments, and line orientation
# MiniCalc evaluates one statement per line.

# Integer arithmetic with +, -, *, /, //, %
10 + 20
50 - 18
6 * 7

# Truncating division (rounds toward zero)
14 / 4
-14 / 4

# Floor division (rounds toward negative infinity)
14 // 4
-14 // 4

# Floored modulo (result takes the sign of the divisor)
14 % 4
-14 % 4

# Unary plus and minus
+42
-42
--42
